  WrittenDialogue: "Well that was certainly an eventful It’s Kelly, wouldn’t you say?\nIt turns out that last guest kidnapped one of my producers so he could sneak onto the show.\nThanks for the ratings I guess?\nThat’s all the time we have for today but if you want more Kelly, make sure to buy my fitness series at your local bookstore!\nThis is Kelly, reminding you to stay perfect! Bye guys!"
